ndent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260102/6956c0cb34efc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260102/6956c0cb34efc.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西官方消息，罗塞尼尔下课，麦克法兰将担任临时主帅。这是麦克法兰本赛季第二次担任切尔西临时主帅。</p><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/match1713712date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">暂登顶！曼城1-0送伯恩利降级 哈兰德单刀闪击制胜+中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1713712_1776890392_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1713712_1776890392_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1713712_1776890392_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼城超阿森纳登顶积分榜！伯恩利提前4轮降级；哈兰德破门，多库助攻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/match1713709date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">14轮不败！伯恩茅斯2-2利兹联 克鲁皮破门拉扬破门朗斯塔夫绝平</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1713709_1776891339_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style=