rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1730655_1776883688_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1730655_1776883688_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>马竞客场大轮换输球，剩6轮领先第5名8分；阿尔马达直红，A席、冈萨雷斯双响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/match1719194date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4分领跑！巴黎3-0完胜南特 克瓦拉茨赫利亚点射+凌波微步双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1719194_1776882994_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1719194_1776882994_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1719194_1776882994_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>克瓦拉茨赫利亚双响+点射，杜埃破门，登贝莱助攻，马尔基尼奥斯造点，巴黎暂时4分领跑！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-23/match1921121date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">决赛会师国米！拉齐奥总比分5-4点球淘汰亚特兰大 莫塔四拒点球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260423/zhanbao_image_1921121_1776894448_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative